    showRequirementModal("Tavern Feast Daily Limit Reached (3/3 Today)", "🍖⏳", "The Boar's Head kitchen can only prepare <b>3 Royal Feasts per day</b>.", "Return tomorrow (or use Admin Reset)!", "");
