        '<span>⚱️ <b>UNRECOVERED SOUL-URN IN CRYPT' + (isMimicNow ? ' [🦷 12H+ MUTATED INTO HOARD-MIMIC!]' : '') + ':</b> Holds <b>' + (hero.deathMarker.gold || 0).toLocaleString() + 'g</b>' + (hero.deathMarker.item ? ' &amp; <b>' + escapeHtml(hero.deathMarker.item.name) + '</b>' : '') + ' (Slain by ' + escapeHtml(hero.deathMarker.slainBy) + '). 🔥 <b>Preserve 1🔥 Torch into Chamber 5 to camp for +30% HP/MP before the Boss!</b></span>' +
        '<button class="btn btn-shine" style="min-height:30px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:11.5px;" onclick="startDungeonDelve(true)">⚱️🔦 Launch Rescue Delve (Torch Camp)</button>' +
